--[[
    AstraUI - Single File Roblox UI Library
    Version: 1.0.0

    GitHub usage (where loadstring/HttpGet is supported):
        local AstraUI = loadstring(game:HttpGet("RAW_GITHUB_URL"))()
        local UI = AstraUI.new()

    Roblox Studio / own experience:
        Put this file into a ModuleScript and use:
        local AstraUI = require(path.To.AstraUI)

    Notes:
    - Client-side UI only.
    - ScreenGui is the primary surface.
    - SurfaceGui/BillboardGui can use the same GuiObject/component patterns.
    - User callbacks are protected with xpcall.
    - Static UI is event-driven; no RenderStepped polling is used.
]]

